      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY GAIN (4) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 4.5 lengths back in third (18.45) at this track in a NG over 320m. Leading chance again. NANGAR ARCHIE (7) is progressing well scoring last time out (18.66) at Dubbo and bringing up his 35th career win. Has a strong record here including five wins. Goes very well from this draw with seven wins and five minor placings from 17 starts. Form should stack up. CRIMSON DYNAMO (2) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when fifth (23.64) in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track. Drifted back and never in it from the wide draw. Form here at the trip sound including nine wins. Has good speed and a low draw is a big help. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SHOT OF FAITH (1) cannot be ruled out.",
